{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this genre was a bad matchup for me, I never managed to come up with enough activities and NPCs to fill out the time. So unfortunately I never managed to finish it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuuki is a raising simulation game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been tasked with looking after an orphaned foxgirl from the Beastkin race for a few months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, it is clear they don't think much of her, and her prospects for the future are bad... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you take this child and help her turn things around in just a few short months? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of future will you help her achieve?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach her various skills; including Archery, Crafts, and Cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impart knowledge on first aid, herbology, and looking after a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help her learn interpersonal relationships through jobs and friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let her fight in the arena? Can do! It has state of the art magic technology to keep participants safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help her overcome herself and gain the confidence to seize control of her future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute and heartfelt story, with fluffy tails and headpats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158740/extras/6ea47beb0dce5f00dae02cbe0a97ff77.poster.avif?t=1740310876\" width=640 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158740/extras/6ea47beb0dce5f00dae02cbe0a97ff77.webm?t=1740310876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an early access title. Since I want to get feedback on what players want adding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with RPGMAKER VX ACE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resolution: 1280x720</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bad End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"Normal End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"True End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"Escape...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"And your reward is clothes... and a happy Yuuki.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"Archery mastered!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"Rival dominated!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"Master of customer service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158740/b9b5260d61e86ec9974064127886bc041f5526f3.jpg"},{"name":"Finally! The headpats!","path":"https://cdn.ak